# Capacitor / native build artefacts.
#
# Codemagic regenerates the iOS and Android native projects on each
# cloud build via `npx cap add ios` / `cap add android`, so committing
# these folders to git would be hundreds of MB of noise. We commit only
# the Capacitor config + plugin list + build scripts; everything below
# is regenerated on demand.

node_modules/
www/

# Native projects (regenerated by Capacitor / Codemagic).
# Leading slash anchors the pattern to mobile/, so mobile/fastlane/metadata/
# android|ios subdirs aren't accidentally caught.
/ios/
/android/

# capacitor-assets PWA output (regenerated by `npm run build:assets`).
icons/

# fastlane runtime artefacts (the configs below are committed; these
# are byproducts of running fastlane locally).
# Note: the fastlane/README.md in this repo is hand-written and committed.
# Don't run `fastlane init` here — it would overwrite it. If you do run
# init by accident, restore from git: `git checkout mobile/fastlane/README.md`.
fastlane/screenshots/
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/test_output/
fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/    # generated when `fastlane supply init` runs
fastlane/metadata/ios/en-US/        # generated when `fastlane deliver init` runs
.bundle/
vendor/bundle/

# Generic node + IDE noise.
.DS_Store
*.log
.idea/
.vscode/
